    {
      "id": "P4kbgrxh4yGXU7jub1Sfs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 670.8000793457031,
      "y": 364.2999572753906,
      "width": 838.5311539215701,
      "height": 317.20001220703125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1598729439,
      "version": 465,
      "versionNonce": 131585777,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775184716009,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Build (Studio & Notebooks)\n\nDevelop, explore, and preprocess data using Amazon SageMaker Studio and Jupyter notebooks.\nFully managed environment → no setup, quick experimentation.\n\n2. Train (Training Jobs)\n\nSageMaker automatically creates EC2 clusters, trains models using data from Amazon S3.\nAuto shutdown after training → cost-efficient and scalable.\n\n3. Deploy (Inference Endpoints)\n\nTrained models are deployed as secure API endpoints for real-time predictions.\nEasy integration with applications for live ML inference.",
      "fontSize": 18.125714983258916,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Build (Studio & Notebooks)\n\nDevelop, explore, and preprocess data using Amazon SageMaker Studio and Jupyter notebooks.\nFully managed environment → no setup, quick experimentation.\n\n2. Train (Training Jobs)\n\nSageMaker automatically creates EC2 clusters, trains models using data from Amazon S3.\nAuto shutdown after training → cost-efficient and scalable.\n\n3. Deploy (Inference Endpoints)\n\nTrained models are deployed as secure API endpoints for real-time predictions.\nEasy integration with applications for live ML inference.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
