      "text": "After that add knowledge base\n,action rules,\nThen on the left panel scroll \nto the bottom and click on Model access\nas i have chosen Nova as model so request access to\nnova model\nthen return to this page and click on prepare and then\nSave and  exit\nNow your agent is ready to test ",
